{"name": "Create a tool via prompt and run every function it generates", "status": "passed", "description": "\n1. Create a new tool via prompt only (Generate Code -> Create Tool) — no\n   file upload involved.\n2. Run every function listed in the 'Test your tool' panel against the\n   prompt-generated code, discovering each function's own parameter\n   names rather than assuming fixed ones.\n\nNote: whether the Output panel actually populates after clicking Test\ncan depend on the tool/backend. The test loop waits for a populated\nresult (falling back to whatever's shown if it times out) and\nscreenshots that, but doesn't assert a specific value, so an\noccasional null result doesn't fail the whole run.\n", "steps": [{"name": "Create a new tool 'QA_Automation_Tool_Prompt' via prompt", "status": "passed", "steps": [{"name": "Navigate to Tools", "status": "passed", "start": 1785851607547, "stop": 1785851607832}, {"name": "Click 'Generate' to start building a new tool", "status": "passed", "start": 1785851607832, "stop": 1785851607986}, {"name": "Choose the 'Custom Tool' (prompt/files) build method", "status": "passed", "start": 1785851607986, "stop": 1785851608166}, {"name": "Enter tool name ''QA_Automation_Tool_Prompt''", "status": "passed", "parameters": [{"name": "tool_name", "value": "'QA_Automation_Tool_Prompt'"}], "start": 1785851608446, "stop": 1785851608636}, {"name": "Enter tool description", "status": "passed", "parameters": [{"name": "description", "value": "'Create a multi-function text utility tool with the following functions:\n\n1. Function: analyzeText\n   Input: text (string)\n   Output: word count, character count (with/without spaces), sentence count\n   Description: Analyze a text block and count words, characters, and sentences.\n\n2. Function: caseConverter\n   Input: text (string), targetCase (uppercase, lowercase, titlecase)\n   Output: the converted text\n   Description: Convert text into the specified case format.\n\n3. Function: wordReverser\n   Input: text (string)\n   Output: the text with word order reversed\n   Description: Reverse the order of words in a sentence.\n\n4. Function: todoFormatter\n   Input: tasks (comma or line separated text)\n   Output: a formatted checklist\n   Description: Convert a list of tasks into a clean checklist with checkboxes.\n\nNotes:\n- Each function should be independent and callable separately.\n- Handle empty or invalid input gracefully with a clear error message.\n- Return results in a clean, readable format.'"}], "start": 1785851608636, "stop": 1785851610277}, {"name": "Click 'Generate Code'", "status": "passed", "start": 1785851610277, "stop": 1785851610424}, {"name": "Wait for code generation to complete", "status": "passed", "parameters": [{"name": "timeout", "value": "600"}], "start": 1785851610425, "stop": 1785851617108}, {"name": "Click 'Create Tool'", "status": "passed", "start": 1785851617781, "stop": 1785851618036}, {"name": "Wait for tool creation to complete", "status": "passed", "parameters": [{"name": "timeout", "value": "600"}], "start": 1785851618036, "stop": 1785851639267}], "attachments": [{"name": "Create Tool form opened", "source": "584f9c1f-3102-40c8-bba6-b663d2373298-attachment.png", "type": "image/png"}, {"name": "Code generated", "source": "21e67186-617c-4ff2-a8c6-389f58d0f78f-attachment.png", "type": "image/png"}, {"name": "Tool created", "source": "6ca806ba-6bf8-43b1-a5d0-8ce743bc92ba-attachment.png", "type": "image/png"}], "start": 1785851607546, "stop": 1785851639310}, {"name": "Update the tool to save the generated code", "status": "passed", "steps": [{"name": "Click 'Update Tool'", "status": "passed", "start": 1785851639311, "stop": 1785851639400}, {"name": "Wait for tool update to complete", "status": "passed", "parameters": [{"name": "timeout", "value": "600"}], "start": 1785851639401, "stop": 1785851660523}], "attachments": [{"name": "Tool updated with generated code", "source": "bada856a-4575-49c1-a569-51654493e672-attachment.png